{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wt271utioHNjteWkajrzJA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:10.123295+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wt271utioHNjteWkajrzJA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDu3dDrAOLEt2z3kptVia9Ql76VyrDIA5B1wjR0SqocZRcmUwM9oOttNTQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>深圳大学简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>特区大学、窗口大学、实验大学</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>深圳大学1983年经教育部批准设立，肩负着为特区培养人才和为国家高等教育改革探路的光荣使命。中央、教育部和地方高度重视深圳大学建设，组织北大援建中文、外语类学科，清华援建电子、建筑类学科，人大援建经济、法律类学科，一大批知名学者云集深圳大学。建校伊始，学校在高校管理体制上锐意改革，在奖学金、学分制、勤工俭学等方面进行了积极探索，率先在国内实行毕业生不包分配和双向选择制度，推行教职员工全员聘任制度和后勤部门社会化管理改革，为中国高等教育改革做出了重要贡献。深圳大学是国家大学生文化素质教育基地、全国文明校园、全国民族团结进步示范学校。</span></p><p><span>建校42年，深圳大学秉承“自立、自律、自强”的校训，紧随特区，锐意改革、快速发展，在较短的时间内形成了从学士、硕士到博士的完整人才培养体系以及多层次的科学研究和社会服务体系，形成了“特区大学、窗口大学、实验大学”的办学特色，培养了近30万各类创新创业人才，95%以上扎根粤港澳大湾区，为特区发展和国家现代化建设做出了重要贡献。特别是进入新时代以来，学校实施高水平大学建设发展战略，成为内地进步最快的大学之一，综合实力得到全面快速提升，创新创业人才培养、人事管理体制等领域的改革走在全国前列。目前，学校已经成为一所特色鲜明、实力雄厚、在国内外具有良好声誉和重要影响力的高水平综合性大学。</span></p><p><span>了解更多可查阅学校官网：</span></p><p><span>https://www.szu.edu.cn</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDuZBM9IP51vUHlNhemXDAzxVMjmCjkP6s6RXsTibzWYAw4iab5TWb4ey7Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>高等研究院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>深圳大学高等研究院成立于2014年，是深圳大学的一个创新综合办学单位，突出小规模、高水平、跨学科、重基础、研究型、国际化的培养模式，下设数学与应用数学、物理学、化学、生物科学四个基础学科方向。近年来，高等研究院围绕空间科学、微生物组学、合成生物学、纳米科学、数据科学等交叉领域，开展创新人才培养、尖端科学研究和高新技术开发。学院现有专任教师49名，专职研究人员25名，博士后80名，拥有多名国家级人才。近5年，在Nature、Nature Communications、Physical Review Letters等国际知名期刊发表论文千余篇。过去三年中毕业的硕士研究生约1/3选择继续深造。国外去向包括：普林斯顿大学、美国西北大学、新加坡国立等国际知名学府；国内去向包括：北京大学、中山大学、厦门大学、上海交通大学、复旦大学、华南理工大学等。此外，约2/3的硕士毕业生选择就业，进入华为、TCL、福田区教育局等知名企业或事业单位工作。</span></p><p><span>高等研究院根据课程特点、学生能力和教学效果，采用中英双语教学。目前，学院设立有8个不同硕士学位点对外招生。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖学金</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>详细学科专业和导师介绍可查阅学校官网：</span></p><p><span>https://ias.szu.edu.cn/rcpy/yjs/gssxwdzdjs.htm</span></p><p><span>研究生奖助学金情况（其中推免生学院奖学金2万元）：</span></p><p><span>https://yz.szu.edu.cn/info/1006/13033.htm</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国高校本科三年级在校生（2026届毕业生），有意攻读研究生者。</span></p><p><span>2.优先考虑数学、物理学、化学、生物学等基础学科方向；</span></p><p><span>3.对基础科研工作有浓厚兴趣、有较好的创新能力、团队组织能力和沟通能力。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>学术硕士：</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>070100数学；070200物理学；070300化学；071000生物学</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>专业学位硕士：</span></strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>025200应用统计；085408光电信息工程；085602化学工程；086001生物技术与工程</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>暑期学校活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>时间安排：</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>预计7月8日-11日</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>活动地点：</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>深圳大学粤海校区</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>活动内容：</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学术报告、师生交流、校内外参访等（以现场活动安排表为准）</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>活动费用：</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>暑期学校期间学院免费提供食宿，暑期学校期间由高等研究院安排的集中学习或考察活动均免费。学员须按要求参加全程的活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>有意向申请的同学自即日起通过以下链接预报名，</span></p><p><span>网址：http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm，并按系统要求提交本人以下各项材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面扫描件或者照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证扫描件或者照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；</span></p><p><span>（4）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（5）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>网上申请截止时间：6月28日，届时将视情况而定是否延期。我院收到申请后，将尽快组织评委进行选拔，并通过邮件及短信方式通知录取结果。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.参加夏令营的学生，颁发暑期研习班结课证书。</span></p><p><span>2.经我院导师推荐，有机会获得“优秀营员”证书。</span></p><p><span>3.学院将为营员购买夏令营期间人身意外伤害险，报到时需签署安全协议。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>往期照片</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDu3h1xlHWpPicvGicZtKadSaSFiaU6QpSbCoM6Q7gRcyxiaoFcqZqtWSeoDQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDuOdbNEc2DxricvQ0jdZqoYKfDDgg6AESCegsDUCxAVhbl5br7C0Psdyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDu8iaqJu8f4T64BsKYfX98ibXloZIw2WnegvLgQMibj9cGjMbLzwVbphwXA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDuR9Zvgdiajyhhd3RqU3hapOP4C7cPTUibj4lerwSfNq3b1PUtrHVXe0tg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDuO4EnoXIILxCBmdCeWicXiaHmvMJJ0Qsxy6siaXGSeAGPftYZm6utadruQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>咨询电话：0755-26530265</span></p><p><span>邮箱：iasyjs@szu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>咨询QQ群：887242903</span></p><p><span>学院网址：https://ias.szu.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span>学院地址：广东省深圳市南山区白石路3883号深圳大学粤海校区致知楼</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>“未来科学家”夏令营</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>期待同学们的到来！</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDumWHcD6MuaV7HVLjPEuaNJglznA15qdXlt1RvS57gV6wHK6j0vAsTQw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/sf282yhE1fUCThjVRgKdJGCJnMpibUIDuvZJ8erZWnPd6W5icjicxomPp4bwXHz6ToCfabd3w4ia5YHQLvoMjfbdew/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"6aa3347e4eb06bda5599affcf889df0c8be144c53633660b6c6fcfb7a21815eb","textLength":2070,"sourceSha256":"5bef8a02425d7385865aceb836ee7081d9e04b9a8f27ee2d23b7be68ca90d7b7","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d746b36bfd26b19931dc","title":"2025年深圳大学高等研究院2026年“未来科学家”夏令营招生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:10.123295+00:00"}
